{"t":"2026-05-20T20:09:19.813Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_012hxTLx6dLX4QWQaYSdARmi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can see Python is available. The tests exist and I've reviewed the code extensively. Let me now analyze what needs to be fixed/completed based on the hypha spec acceptance criteria and the existing code.\n\nBased on my comprehensive review of the codebase, I can see:\n\n1. **All core application engine files exist** and are substantially implemented:\n   - `jd_parser.py` - Complete with Claude integration and caching\n   - `resume_tailor.py` - Complete with Claude-based tailoring \n   - `company_intel.py` - Complete with scraping and Claude synthesis\n   - `contact_finder.py` - Complete with Hunter.io and fallbacks\n   - `outreach_composer.py` - Complete with Claude composition\n   - `auto_apply.py` - Complete with Playwright ATS handling and CAPTCHA detection\n   - `crm.py` - Complete with event logging\n   - `orchestrator.py` - Complete with parallel execution\n\n2. **Tests exist** in `tests/application/test_orchestrator.py`\n\n3. **Schema mismatches need fixing** - The schemas in `schemas.py` don't fully match what the agents are using:\n   - `ParsedJDSchema` is missing fields like `team_context`, `key_responsibilities`, `culture_signals` (as dict), `comp_mentioned`\n   - `TailoredResumeSchema` is missing fields like `version`, `summary`, `job_id`, `candidate_id` \n   - `CompanyIntelSchema` is missing fields like `domain`, `cache_age`, `glassdoor_signals`, `cache_expires_at`\n   - `OutreachEmailSchema` is missing fields like `job_id`, `candidate_id`, `to`, `subject`, `subject_variants`, `tone_used`, `hook_used`\n   - `ContactSchema` is missing fields like `company_intel_id`, and default values for `name`, `title`, `email`\n\n4. **The `__init__.py` is empty** - needs exports\n\nLet me fix these issues:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":196,"cache_read_input_tokens":94802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":196,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"deb7dcc2-71e5-4120-93c5-a6ba962cce9e","uuid":"b6352aeb-7585-4e05-b6ca-e9c5caf8bab0"}}
